`VenueCourtsModal.tsx:322` renders `{court.courtName}` — so the mock's courts `{ id, name }` would render an **empty court name** in the modal. Let me confirm the test asserts anything about it. The test 'court counts are bold on the schedule and venue selector':
```
await courtSettingsButton.click();
